      "seat": "seat-strat-1",
      "text": "A scheme with s products proves rank ≤ s. Refuting Record s proves rank ≥ s + 1. For AlphaTensor’s factor archives, each column gives one term. Transpose the third factor from (column, row) to (row, column) for MatMul.Term.output. For concrete coefficient tables, unfold IsMatMulSchemeInt or IsMatMulSchemeF2 and use decide +kernel. https://github.com/google-deepmind/alphatensor/tree/1949163da3bef7e3eb268a3ac015fd1c2dbfc767/algorithms",
